---@field registeredAt? aws.ecs.Timestamp The Unix timestamp for the time when the container instance was registered.
---@field attachments? aws.ecs.Attachments The resources attached to a container instance, such as an elastic network interface.
---@field tags? aws.ecs.Tags The metadata that you apply to the container instance to help you categorize and organize them. Each tag consists of a key and an optional value. You define both.
