---@field devices? aws.ecs.DevicesList Any host devices to expose to the container.
---@field initProcessEnabled? aws.ecs.BoxedBoolean Run an init process inside the container that forwards signals and reaps processes.
---@field tmpfs? aws.ecs.TmpfsList The container path, mount options, and size (in MiB) of the tmpfs mount.

