---@field registeredBy? aws.ecs.String The principal that registered the daemon task definition.
---@field deleteRequestedAt? aws.ecs.Timestamp The Unix timestamp for the time when the daemon task definition delete was requested.
---@field status? aws.ecs.DaemonTaskDefinitionStatus The status of the daemon task definition.

---A data volume definition for a daemon task.
---@class aws.ecs.DaemonVolume
---@field name? aws.ecs.String The name of the volume. Up to 255 letters (uppercase and lowercase), numbers, underscores, and hyphens are allowed.
