---@field iam? aws.ecs.EFSAuthorizationConfigIAM|string Determines whether to use the Amazon ECS task role defined in a task definition when mounting the Amazon EFS file system. If it is turned on, transit encryption must be turned on in the EFSVolumeConfiguration. If this parameter is omitted, the default value of DISABLED is used. For more information, see Using Amazon EFS access points in the Amazon Elastic Container Service Developer Guide.

