---@field enableFaultInjection? aws.ecs.BoxedBoolean Enables fault injection when you register your task definition and allows for fault injection requests to be accepted from the task's containers. The default value is false.
---@field trustedExecutionConfiguration? aws.ecs.TrustedExecutionConfiguration The trusted execution configuration for tasks that use this task definition, including the isolation mode and, if configured, an attestation policy.

